}
```
And add after `.btn { border: none; }`:
```css
.btn-default,
.btn-default:link,
.btn-default:visited {
  color: #333;
}
```
This is minimal. But note `.btn-default:hover`/`:active` not included; Bootstrap handles them with specificity (0,2,0) > `a:hover` (0,1,1), so fine. For `.btn-default:link`/`:visited`, our rule (0,2,0) beats `a:link` (0,1,1). Good.

